	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 7th level, a gunslinger can use their exertion to fuel additional options.</p><p><strong>Dustkiss:</strong> As a reaction to rolling a Dexterity save for half damage, you can press into nearby cover, or drop prone if there is no cover within 5ft, to take no damage if you succeeded the saving throw.</p><p><strong>Hostage Taker:</strong> While grappling another medium sized or smaller creature, the gunslinger can spend a grit as a bonus action to gain three-quarters cover from a direction of your choice until the start of your next turn or the grapple ends, whichever comes first.</p>",
